---
import Layout from "../layouts/Post.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="About Us"
	description="About Firelands Core Project"
	pubDate={new Date("September 11 2023")}
    titleEn="About Us"
    titleEs="Acerca de"
>
    <div class="about-container">
        <section class="mission">
            <div class="mission-content">
                <h2>
                    <span class="lang-en">Our Mission</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Nuestra Misión</span>
                </h2>
                <p>
                    <span class="lang-en">Firelands Core Project is an open-source community dedicated to developing a high-fidelity emulator for <strong>World of Warcraft: Cataclysm (v4.3.4)</strong>. Founded with an educational purpose, we believe in the power of collaborative learning and the preservation of gaming history.</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Firelands Core Project es una comunidad de código abierto dedicada a desarrollar un emulador de alta fidelidad para <strong>World of Warcraft: Cataclysm (v4.3.4)</strong>. Fundado con un propósito educativo, creemos en el poder del aprendizaje colaborativo y la preservación de la historia de los videojuegos.</span>
                </p>
                <div class="glow-divider"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">🎓</div>
                <h3>
                    <span class="lang-en">Educational</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Educativo</span>
                </h3>
                <p>
                    <span class="lang-en">Designed as a learning platform for software architecture, reverse engineering, and database management.</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Diseñado como plataforma de aprendizaje para arquitectura de software, ingeniería inversa y gestión de bases de datos.</span>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">🤝</div>
                <h3>
                    <span class="lang-en">Community Driven</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Impulsado por la Comunidad</span>
                </h3>
                <p>
                    <span class="lang-en">We believe the best core is built by many hands. Everyone is welcome to contribute, regardless of skill level.</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Creemos que el mejor núcleo es construido por muchas manos. Todos son bienvenidos a contribuir, sin importar su nivel de habilidad.</span>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">🔥</div>
                <h3>
                    <span class="lang-en">Performance</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Rendimiento</span>
                </h3>
                <p>
                    <span class="lang-en">Optimized for modern hardware, focusing on stability and high concurrency for the best player experience.</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Optimizado para hardware moderno, enfocándose en estabilidad y alta concurrencia para la mejor experiencia de juego.</span>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">⚖️</div>
                <h3>
                    <span class="lang-en">Open Source</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Código Abierto</span>
                </h3>
                <p>
                    <span class="lang-en">Our code is and will always be open. Transparency and freedom are at the heart of our development.</span>
                    <span class="lang-es">Nuestro código es y siempre será abierto. La transparencia y libertad están en el corazón de nuestro desarrollo.</span>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="long-content">
            <h3>
                <span class="lang-en">Our Journey</span>
                <span class="lang-es">Nuestro Viaje</span>
            </h3>
            <p>
                <span class="lang-en">The Firelands Core Project started as a small group of enthusiasts who wanted to explore the complexities of the Cataclysm expansion. Over time, it has evolved into a robust ecosystem where developers from around the world share their knowledge.</span>
                <span class="lang-es">El Proyecto Firelands Core comenzó como un pequeño grupo de entusiastas que querían explorar las complejidades de la expansión Cataclysm. Con el tiempo, ha evolucionado en un ecosistema robusto donde desarrolladores de todo el mundo comparten su conocimiento.</span>
            </p>
            <blockquote>
                <span class="lang-en">"To make the best emulator, we don't just need code; we need a community that values learning above all else."</span>
                <span class="lang-es">"Para hacer el mejor emulador, no solo necesitamos código; necesitamos una comunidad que valore el aprendizaje por encima de todo lo demás."</span>
            </blockquote>
            <p>
                <span class="lang-en">Our intention is to create a community in which people can participate, learn, study, and contribute. Whether you are a seasoned C++ developer or just starting your journey into SQL, there is a place for you in the Firelands.</span>
                <span class="lang-es">Nuestra intención es crear una comunidad en la que las personas puedan participar, aprender, estudiar y contribuir. Ya seas un desarrollador experimentado de C++ o apenas comenzando tu viaje en SQL, hay un lugar para ti en Firelands.</span>
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>

    <style>
        .about-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4rem;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out;
            position: relative;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .about-container::before {
            content: 'FIRELANDS';
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            right: -20px;
            font-size: 8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: rgba(var(--accent), 0.03);
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
            font-family: 'Metamorphous', serif;
        }

        .mission {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }

        .mission h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgb(var(--gold)), rgb(var(--accent)));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-shadow: none;
        }

        .mission p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
            line-height: 1.8;
        }


        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent), 0.1);
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .feature-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(var(--accent), 0.1), transparent);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: rgba(var(--accent), 0.4);
            background: rgba(var(--accent), 0.05);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .feature-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .feature-card .icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover .icon {
            transform: scale(1.2) rotate(5deg);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(var(--accent), 0.5));
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: rgb(var(--gold));
        }

        .feature-card p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: rgb(var(--gray));
            margin: 0;
        }

        .glow-divider {
            height: 2px;
            width: 200px;
            margin: 3rem auto 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgb(var(--accent)), transparent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(var(--accent), 0.5);
            position: relative;
        }

        .glow-divider::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background: rgb(var(--gold));
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgb(var(--gold));
        }

        .long-content {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border-left: 4px solid rgb(var(--accent));
        }

        .long-content h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .mission h2 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            .long-content {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</Layout>